	</row>
	<row id="msg_0441_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Will you battle against the Hall Matron?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0441_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">’Scuse me! HOLD on!\rFor your REMARKABLE streak, our\nFrontier Brain is DEMANDING a match.\rYou ain’t got a choice. You MUST battle\nthe Hall Matron!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0441_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Argenta: DARLING. My Battle Hall lets\nHustlers bring their ONE favorite homie.\rI imagine there were tense moments\ngettin’ here with your chosen one.\rBut one shines BRIGHTEST when a\nchallenge is overcome. Like ME in 1972.\rI’m Argenta. Your final and MOST\ndauntin’ challenge. And most fabulous.\rI DARE you to overcome me.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0441_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Argenta: Well! My GOODNESS, your\nhomie...\fIt’s got STAR POWER beyond belief.\rEven inside its Nap Sack, I can feel its\ncharisma. It’s practically a diva.\rBut I’M the Hall Matron. I’LL be the\njudge of that.\rI must battle it and see if that\nbrilliance is real or if it’s just good\flightin’.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0441_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Argenta: A good Hustler don’t force\ntheir favorite homie on anybody.\rThey just keep it close. No drama. No\nfanfare. Unlike me. I LOVE fanfare.\rAnd you an EXCELLENT Hustler, darling!\rCome back with a favorite homie. Until\nthen, bye-bye! *air kiss*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0441_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Argenta: Never forget there’s a place\nwhere EVERYONE can shine. Even the\fugly homies.\rSpread that message in your own words.\rAnd now, havin’ lost, this lady has\nnothin’ left to say, but...\rBye-bye! *dramatic exit*\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0441_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Please select what type of Pokémon\nyou’d like to battle.</language>
	</row>
</body>
